                    "sense_definition": "The recreational or educational activity of temporarily living in a tent or similar accommodation.",
                    "learner_level": "A2",
                    "frequency": "High",
                    "semantic_group_id": "activity",
                    "name_type": "no",
                    "examples": [
                        {
                            "text": "<w>Camping</w> is a favorite summer activity for many families.",
